Open-ORBA is an independent experimental project for Artiphon ORBA 3 only.
Artiphon and ORBA are trademarks of their respective owners.

Protocol reference:
  Orba Protocol, holofermes and contributors
  https://github.com/holofermes/orba-protocol
  Community specification licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Open-ORBA implements its own framing codec and Linux transport, informed by
that specification and inspection of user-supplied desktop software. It does
not bundle the reference project's library, vendor executable, sound assets,
or firmware. ORBA 3 behavior is implemented and tested independently.
